        "operationId": "automations.dataset.export",
        "summary": "Export automation dataset",
        "description": "Download the automation dataset as a ZIP archive. The archive uses the examples/<name>/input and examples/<name>/expected folder convention, so it can be re-imported into another automation or environment. Cloud deployments may redirect large archives to a short-lived storage URL.",
